{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-36","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：最小公倍数与整数","englishTitle":"Given three numbers, to find the least number which they measure.","book":7,"number":36,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":36,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","contentId":"euclid-7-36","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e617764be9f003a403d66b425a9a3838d538598f6ef7de4289ff91b07cf1be5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-36.statement","euclid-7-36.construction.1","euclid-7-36.construction.2","euclid-7-36.proof.1","euclid-7-36.proof.2","euclid-7-36.proof.3","euclid-7-36.proof.4","euclid-7-36.proof.5","euclid-7-36.construction.3","euclid-7-36.proof.6","euclid-7-36.proof.7","euclid-7-36.proof.8","euclid-7-36.proof.9","euclid-7-36.proof.10","euclid-7-36.proof.11","euclid-7-36.proof.12","euclid-7-36.proof.13","euclid-7-36.proof.14","euclid-7-36.construction.4","euclid-7-36.proof.15","euclid-7-36.proof.16","euclid-7-36.proof.17","euclid-7-36.proof.18","euclid-7-36.proof.19","euclid-7-36.conclusion","euclid-7-36.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-36.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5a02edf064a95d028d89a6125344f25e731640941633f7a9637c4defb17a021","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given three numbers, to find the least number which they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给出三个数字 找到它们最少的整除个数字"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ce7b7c330ce8d769b3872af7d2d9ef225968d1de1a9d2182fd562564586310c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the three given numbers; thus it is required to find the least number which they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让3个给定数字为A,B,C;因此,需要找到最少的整除个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88a19643b7782782e640d6b547158e2678c221085fa9253b450ae10c8175d800","citations":["euclid-7-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let D, the least number measured by the two numbers A, B, be taken. [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D,用两个数字 A,B整除的最少数字 [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17c549e3f296b8b47c6fc9e16049121b08dcf5b3a900afe2d3d2ccf48e847a8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then C either measures, or does not measure, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C或者整除,或者不是整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"417172124a383d5eb40b139503383efeb7cf5d197da3c58bd3e953cd3ad77efa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它整除它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bba4fca1f36039f0f71c743dd639e4dc4b9d1ba21f6a8b67cd9b10917e6a095","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, B also measure D; therefore A, B, C measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,B 还有整除,D; 因此A,B,C,整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce04c8ffca931ed0ddff0296e2d946da2b8ec9671e3335742f7aeea6d85aaafe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the least that they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,这也是它们整除的最低要求。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e0070ed7bf9537c8939e4e7f6902d489a5628e5d57cb5fcf7c52ca4d86e4e7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, A, B, C will measure some number which is less than D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,A,B,C将达到整除个,不到D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cc4e80b8b27538e912ca52db1778c0e67de081d2f29b372b501a714fe21df9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them measure E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除、E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38f3f25578703a591708834e21e0e63594c6422b36ae536c4254792814be266a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since A, B, C measure E, therefore also A, B measure E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自A、B、C、整除、E以来,因此,还有A、B、整除、E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"344cd9cf0d0f6f37b1ef5b36eb418b3ece2dd0ecd97e86a533af36b16d2c480e","citations":["euclid-7-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the least number measured by A, B will also measure E. [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以A、B为标准的最低数字也将是整除、E。 [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13a88bc293f6cdc64fc3ceda6252f03409fb97cc55349c438314f12820827a52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is the least number measured by A, B; therefore D will measure E, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D是A,B的最小数,因此D将达到整除,E,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a89da0fdad1cc52595e613f5cc7e194ef32945db79efdda9a881d8a6ee0e4147","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B, C will not measure any number which is less than D; therefore D is the least that A, B, C measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B,C,不会有少于D的任何整除个数字;因此,D是最少的A,B,C,整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"681a1d6f5ae93e6d5ef015900569e4f552420424bb46bdc1aa59295e22034b94","citations":["euclid-7-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C not measure D, and let E, the least number measured by C, D, be taken. [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C比整除、D,E,以C比D整除的最低数字。 [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d920271c3b08cdd59488c3b43624251b44a6cece323e1fd9fb12f0a9d1f29b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since A, B measure D, and D measures E, therefore also A, B measure E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自A、B、整除、D和D、整除、E以来,因此,还有A、B、整除、E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"daed984858b3f7fca745fd3b89d5da30b4ca0acd04b60d6052c4448fb49bbf52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But C also measures E; therefore also A, B, C measure E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C也是整除 E,因此还有A B,C 整除 E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce04c8ffca931ed0ddff0296e2d946da2b8ec9671e3335742f7aeea6d85aaafe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the least that they measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,这也是它们整除的最低要求。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e94019ca0b3f8f25e4c2249ebacd297803a91b9dac495dd0e3397f3cad12b5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, A, B, C will measure some number which is less than E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,A,B,C将达到整除个,不到E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":18,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17d71a60b138607ef67fe3c130a7c39f21cbb0073dcd77c20aee1dded3bc3bbd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them measure F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除、F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66f5ac90458c941dbe64b8855cadb0f677f7d2a24b26a025138318be4659f366","citations":["euclid-7-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since A, B, C measure F, therefore also A, B measure F; therefore the least number measured by A, B will also measure F. [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自A、B、C、整除、F以来,因此,还有A、B、整除、F;因此,以A、B整除的最低数字也将是整除、F。 [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"561d8d3c4620f65614584492c28f25d42706d266d7289379134209d70fdfafc0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is the least number measured by A, B; therefore D measures F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D是整除为A,B的最小数字,因此是D,整除,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"975cbd13e6d351e270d72702ca487fad78ebcbaf4a0d6976fe2d17dd1020b616","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But C also measures F; therefore D, C measure F, so that the least number measured by D, C will also measure F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C也是整除 F,因此D,C 整除 F,这样,以D整除的最低数字,C也将是整除 F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f68511e9f942efbfdb3bf2bf481186a5945313c2daad93d906cbcfa7ef0336f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E is the least number measured by C, D; therefore E measures F, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E是C,D的最小数字,因此,E,整除,F,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6588e0810dee712bf06624be9a757f790cd80a8fb5f90d20d3e227ad393373b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B, C will not measure any number which is less than E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B,C 将不少于E的任何整除个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":24,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4d56ee97947a784f5692b42156315f1dd2a1510b2d180c6b877caf77bbb3685","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E is the least that is measured by A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E是整除为A、B、C、Q、E、D的最少数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-36.source","contentId":"euclid-7-36","revisionId":"euclid-7-36@raw-4e617764be9f003a","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c062eb10a2b8169d6c53dcbe75e85fc6d501a8d00ef1660d22e55d6bc140fc3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-36:euclid-7-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-36.construction.2","euclid-7-36.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36/","sourceLabel":"VII. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-36:euclid-7-35:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-36.proof.7","euclid-7-36.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-35","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36/","sourceLabel":"VII. 35"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-39:euclid-7-36:exp